Scope
-----

This MIT license covers the original source code authored for this project:

  * PS5_FFPFSC_ULTRA_v1.0.py                     (the GUI application)
  * backend/cli.py, backend/fpkg.py,             (Python wrappers around the
    backend/copy_job.py, backend/fake_sign.py     bundled tools)
  * backend/native/src/ffpfsc-pkg-tool/**        (the C# wrapper around
                                                  LibProsperoPkg)
  * All Python test suites under backend/tests/
  * The build scripts (BUILD_MACOS_APP.sh, BUILD_EXE.bat, PyInstaller specs)
  * Everything under images/ authored for this project

Bundled third-party components keep their own licenses. See NOTICES.md at the
repository root for the full list of bundled components, their upstream
authors, and their licensing. The compiled application binary — because it
statically embeds MkPFS (GPL-3.0-or-later) and LibProsperoPkg 1.2.0
(GPL-3.0-or-later) — is a combined work under the terms of the GNU General
Public License, version 3, per GPL-3 section 5. All source needed to
reproduce it is present in this repository, and every bundled component's
license is compatible with that combination.
